2026-06-19 16:51:22,239 | AGENT | ProjectCoordinator Agent answered: As Project Coordinator for Faber IA, I will utilize our hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. This approach aligns well with the requirement for progressive project conduct.

